# The input, fetched by `make` from github.com/arbace/slim-vim at the commit in
# src/upstream.sha.  Not tracked: this repository records WHICH slim-vim.c it
# was built from (src/upstream.sha, and its digest in src/slim.sha), as
# arbace/slim-vim records the upstream vim commit it was built from and not the
# tree.
/src/slim-vim.c

# The binaries: the input's and the C product's, and the editors'.
/bin/

# The Java, Clojure and Haskell editors' builds: their sources and classes
# or objects (make bin/braaam, bin/vijure, bin/caprice), and the same as one
# jar at the top (make braaam.jar, vijure.jar).
/lib/
/braaam.jar
/vijure.jar

# The Go editor as one go-lisp file (make editor.lgo, doc/GO-LISP.md).
/editor.lgo
# The Haskell editor's core as one ghc-lisp module (make caprice.hsl, doc/GHC-LISP.md).
/caprice.hsl
# The C product as C-lisp (make whim-vim.lc, doc/C-LISP.md).
/whim-vim.lc


# The baselines the removed test suite recorded (448e9a8 and before).  Nothing
# reads them any more.
.reference/

# What a sweep compiles, the symbol cache and the binaries' stamps: deleting
# it costs only the time to build again.  (The toolset itself is `go tool
# whim`, cached by Go.)
.cache/

# What a bare `go build ./cmd/whim` would leave at the root.
/whim

# Every temporary goes here, not the shared /tmp: the Makefile exports
# TMPDIR to it, and worktrees go in .tmp/worktrees/.
.tmp/

# Editor swap files: vim names the first .swp and then walks backwards.
*.sw[a-p]

.claude/

# The Rust editor's cargo output and lock, where cargo is run in whimsy/ by
# hand (go tool whim whimsy builds in lib/whimsy), and the backend's notes
# beside a module written there by `whim skel -rs` (.host, .layout, .refused).
/whimsy/target/
/whimsy/Cargo.lock
/whimsy/src/editor.rs.*

# The Scheme editor's notes beside a library written in whimsical/whimsical/
# by `whim skel -scm` by hand (.host, .layout, .refused), and what Chez
# compiles there (go tool whim whimsical builds in lib/whimsical).
/whimsical/whimsical/editor.ss.*
/whimsical/whimsical/*.so
/whimsical/*.so
